📊 Sales Data Analysis Project
🧾 Overview

This project is a complete end-to-end Data Analytics solution built using Excel, MySQL, Python, and Streamlit.
It analyzes sales data to generate business insights such as total sales, top products, and city-wise performance.

🚀 Features
Data cleaning and preparation using Excel
Data storage and querying using MySQL
Data analysis using Python (Pandas)
Interactive dashboard using Streamlit
KPI metrics (Total Sales, Orders, Products)
City-wise and Product-wise sales visualization
🛠️ Tech Stack
Python 🐍
MySQL 🗄️
Excel 📊
Pandas 📦
Streamlit 🌐
Matplotlib 📈


